{"asset_key":"mn3/herohub_story_10414050","episode":"mn3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10414050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041405001:1":{"text":"Why does Atalanta carry a whip at her waist?","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒小姐为什么要在腰上挂一支鞭子呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE699DE670620287","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041405002:1":{"text":"Hmm? It's for properly disciplining naughty kids... Just kidding!","source_cn":"嗯？当然是为了好好惩罚一些不听话的坏孩子——开玩笑的啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2312F92C0731D155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041405003:1":{"text":"This is what it's used for. Watch this!","source_cn":"实际上是——嘿！看招！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088C8975519DF368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041405004:1":{"text":"Ahhh! That scared Chippy! But wow, you slashed that fluttering leaf straight in half!","source_cn":"——哇啊啊啊啊！飞落的叶子，被击中了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5DC4E682926B02B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1041405004":{"text":"Ahhh! That scared Chippy! But wow, you slashed that fluttering leaf straight in half!","source_cn":"——哇啊啊啊啊！飞落的叶子，被击中了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5DC4E682926B02B","variant_statu