That's where my precious whip comes in handy. It's not only good for attacking, but it can also grab small items from a distance.","source_cn":"这种时候，就靠我的宝贝鞭子出场了。不光能攻击，连有些小物件也能用鞭子卷过来哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x855E9EFDEF5F85A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041405009:1":{"text":"You often run into traps while adventuring. Whether magical or mechanical, falling into one can be a real headache. ","source_cn":"嗯哼，一般来说都有陷阱。无论是魔法还是机关，一旦中了可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82A52EBFB83DC9A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041405010:1":{"text":"So having the proper tools is essential.","source_cn":"所以能远程取物或者进行试探的道具就很有必要了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x859F5E752B204AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041405011:1":{"text":"If I had a team of thieves like those, uh, teams, I'd probably carry a mix of tools and weapons.","source_cn":"如果我也像那些盗贼那样有个团伙……咳咳，团队，我大概也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B7F0C7E7807DC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041405012:1":{"text":"But for now, going solo has its conveniences, and I don't have to split the loot—uh, I mean, share the rewards!","source_cn":"不过目前来看嘛，独来独往也自有方便之处，而且还不用分赃...","status":"matched",